OL,3,AAugust joint-hottest month on record as
OL,4,Aclimate change and El Nino drive heat
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile a single month above 1.5C does
OL,7,Fnot mean it has been permanently
OL,8,Fcrossed, it shows a trend towards
OL,9,Fbreaching that limit.
